              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "HeartySieve6776"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Im sure this is OK , But: Originally pink lemonade was made from lemon juice and pink grapefruit juice. The frozen store bought pink lemonade I find has grape juice and lemon juice. Neither is \" old fashioned\" I was surprised No one pointed this out. FYI",
            "datePublished": "2023-09-29T17:00:00.191Z"
          },
